OL,3,GNEWSARugby club says former player was
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuildfordians Rugby Club has said
OL,7,Fformer player Max Redding was one of
OL,8,Fthe two young people killed in a crash
OL,9,Fon the A246 near East Clandon.
OL,11,FThe club issued a tribute to the former
OL,12,Fyouth and senior player a week after
OL,13,Fthe collision on Epsom Road.
OL,15,F"Max was never someone who could be
OL,16,Fsummed up simply," they said. "He was a
OL,17,Fcomplex character, full of energy,
OL,18,Fdetermination, strength and spirit.
OL,19,FSomeone whose presence made an
OL,20,Fimpression on everyone fortunate enough
OL,21,Fto know him."
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
